<title>USA: Dress Barn to buy back up to 400,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Dress Barn to buy back up to 400,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>SUFFERN, N.Y. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dress Barn Inc said Tuesday its board had authorized the company to buy back up to 400,000 common shares.</p>
<p>The 400,000 shares is equal to the increase in the company's outstanding shares arising from the exercise of stock uptions for the fiscal year ending July 28, it said.</p>
<p>Dress Barn, a national women's clothing retailer, operates 700 stores in 43 states.</p>
